{
  "tema": 8703,
  "slug": "cuanto-cuantos-cuantas",
  "titulo": "Cuánto in questions, exclamations and indirect questions",
  "subtitulo": "¿Cuánto cuesta? ¡Cuánta gente! No sé cuántos años tiene.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Cuánto means how much / how many. Before a noun it agrees: cuánto, cuánta, cuántos, cuántas. Before a verb it stays cuánto. It always carries an accent: in direct questions, in exclamations and in indirect questions.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Cuánto** asks about quantity: _how much_ or _how many_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Before a noun**, it agrees with that noun in gender and number:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Singular",
            "Plural"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Masculine",
              "¿cuánto dinero?",
              "¿cuántos años?"
            ],
            [
              "Feminine",
              "¿cuánta agua?",
              "¿cuántas horas?"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Before a verb**, it doesn't change: **¿Cuánto cuesta?**, **¿Cuánto trabajas?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works in three kinds of sentences, always **with an accent**:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Type",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Direct question",
              "¿Cuántos hermanos tienes?"
            ],
            [
              "Exclamation",
              "¡Cuánta gente!"
            ],
            [
              "Indirect question",
              "No sé cuánto cuesta."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In Mexico you'll also hear **¿qué tanto?** for _how much_: _¿Qué tanto te falta?_"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **cuánto** is a measuring cup. It takes the shape of whatever you pour in: **cuánta** agua, **cuántos** tacos."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Cuánto== cuesta la tabla?",
              "en": "How much is the board?"
            },
            {
