              "en": "How many times a week do you train?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Cuánta== agua necesitan las lechugas?",
              "en": "How much water do the lettuces need?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¡==Cuántos== carros hay en la garita!",
              "en": "So many cars at the border crossing!"
            },
            {
              "es": "¡==Cuánto== has crecido!",
              "en": "How much you've grown!"
            },
            {
              "es": "No sé ==cuántos== años tiene Amos.",
              "en": "I don't know how old Amos is."
            },
            {
              "es": "Me preguntó ==cuánto== gano.",
              "en": "He asked me how much I earn."
            },
            {
              "es": "Dime ==cuántas== personas vienen a la carne asada.",
              "en": "Tell me how many people are coming to the cookout."
            }
